  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH plugin ecosystem added 54 new plugins (18,103 total) and 182 official stars, led by dsh-market (+31) and awesome-dsh-plugin (+30), alongside the 0.2.1-alpha.1 release. Ecosystem health score sits at 39, with 13,973 of 17,840 non-fork plugins stale for 7+ days, so activity quality is worth watching more than raw growth.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>54</b> 个插件，总量达 <b>18103</b>，官方仓库星标涨了 <b>182</b>；增长榜由 dsh-market（+<b>31</b>）和 awesome-dsh-plugin（+<b>30</b>）领跑，同时官方放出 <b>0.2.1-alpha.1</b> 版本。不过健康分仅 <b>39</b>，<b>17840</b> 个非 fork 插件里有 <b>13973</b> 个超过 7 天没动静，建议持续观察活跃度而非只看新增数。"
  }
